{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"code":"object","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is floating, sink it.  Otherwise, do nothing.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"takeRef","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/ObjectRef","text":"ObjectRef","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10GLibObject0B3RefV"},{"text":"!","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In other words, this function will convert a floating reference (if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"present) into a full reference.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Typically you want to use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g_object_ref_sink()"},{"type":"text","text":" in order to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"automatically do the correct thing with respect to floating or"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"non-floating references, but there is one specific scenario where","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"this function is helpful.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The situation where this function is helpful is when creating an API","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that allows the user to provide a callback function that returns a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"GObject. We certainly want to allow the user the flexibility to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"return a non-floating reference from this callback (for the case","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"where the object that is being returned already exists).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"At the same time, the API style of some popular GObject-based"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"libraries (such as Gtk) make it likely that for newly-created GObject","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instances, the user can be saved some typing if they are allowed to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"return a floating reference.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Using this function on the return value of the user’s callback allows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the user to do whichever is more convenient for them. The caller will","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"always receives exactly one full reference to the value: either the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one that was returned in the first place, or a floating reference","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that has been converted to a full reference."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This function has an odd interaction when combined with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g_object_ref_sink()"},{"text":" running at the same time in another thread on","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the same ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/Object","isActive":true},{"text":" instance. If ","type":"text"},{"code":"g_object_ref_sink()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs first then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the result will be that the floating reference is converted to a hard","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reference. If "},{"code":"g_object_take_ref()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs first then the result will be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"that the floating reference is converted to a hard reference and an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"additional reference on top of that one is added. It is best to avoid","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"this situation."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/glibobject\/object\/takeref()"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/Object\/takeRef()"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/Object","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/Object\/ObjectProtocol-Implementations"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"takeRef","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10GLibObject0B3RefV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ObjectRef"},{"text":"!","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"GLibObject"}],"extendedModule":"GLibObject","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:10GLibObject0B8ProtocolPAAE7takeRefAA0bE0VSgyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:10GLibObject0B0C","title":"takeRef()","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"references":{"doc://GLibObject/documentation/GLibObject/Object/ObjectProtocol-Implementations":{"kind":"article","title":"ObjectProtocol Implementations","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/Object\/ObjectProtocol-Implementations","url":"\/documentation\/glibobject\/object\/objectprotocol-implementations","role":"collectionGroup","abstract":[]},"doc://GLibObject/documentation/GLibObject/Object/takeRef()":{"abstract":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"object"},{"text":" is floating, sink it.  Otherwise, do nothing.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"takeRef"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10GLibObject0B3RefV","text":"ObjectRef","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"!","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/Object\/takeRef()","url":"\/documentation\/glibobject\/object\/takeref()","title":"takeRef()","role":"symbol"},"doc://GLibObject/documentation/GLibObject":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/glibobject","title":"GLibObject","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GLibObject/documentation/GLibObject/ObjectRef":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"ObjectRef","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ObjectRef","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The base object type.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/ObjectRef","url":"\/documentation\/glibobject\/objectref","role":"symbol","title":"ObjectRef"},"doc://GLibObject/documentation/GLibObject/Object":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Object","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/glibobject\/object","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/Object","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The base object type."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Object","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Object"}]}}}